starlink revenue and other lines of business could shift priorities. The outcome will influence how

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:39.920
aggressively the firm pursues rapid reuse milestones and new vehicle development. The company delivered an

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:47.760
engineering mock-up of its lunar land or tenasa as part of ongoing Artemis work. CEO Dave Limpe

